  "description": "The proposed works comprise the installation of a new insulated roof construction and the application of an External Wall Insulation (EWI) system to improve the thermal performance of the existing building. The roof works will include the installation of new roof tiles. The finished roof covering will be in a Tudor brown tone to match the surrounding area and maintain visual consistency. Existing internal ceiling finishes will be retained where not affected by the works. The external walls will be upgraded with a new EWI system applied to the existing clad areas. This will improve thermal continuity and overall building performance. The system will be finished with a render coating, with a cream/white colour maintained to match the existing appearance and preserve the character of the surrounding area.",
